bez: Bezier _ G3dSpline.BezierFromSpline[tube.spline];
bez: Bezier _ BezierFromHermite[tube.p0, tube.p1, tube.v0, tube.v1];
Keep scale non-zero (to avoid subsequent surface normal computation problems):
